        <p style="font:400 15.5px/1.65 var(--font-body);color:var(--text-secondary);margin:0;text-wrap:pretty">Token launches, exchange listings, and game releases have fixed dates and a security review in front of them. Contract audits in particular need lead time because remediation means redeploying. Bring us in at code freeze, not after.</p>
